{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Eightfold.FureyMinimalLeftIdeal","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyMinimalLeftIdeal","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.OctonionComplexStructure","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.OctonionDerivationProperties"],"declarations":32,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.Le_fock","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.Le_fock","kind":"theorem","line":246,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L246-L253","doc":"**The `e₁`-complex structure is `−i (−1)^N`** on the Fock basis: `L(e₁)` acts by `−i`\non levels 0, 2 and by `+i` on levels 1, 3. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.eOne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.eOne","kind":"def","line":243,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L243-L244","doc":"The unit `e₁` over `R`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.numOp_fock","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.numOp_fock","kind":"theorem","line":234,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L234-L241","doc":"**Number grading**: `N (fock k) = level k · fock k`; levels `0,1,1,1,2,2,2,3`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.numOp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.numOp","kind":"def","line":231,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L231-L232","doc":"The (scaled) number operator `4N = Σⱼ βⱼ†βⱼ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.Bd_top","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.Bd_top","kind":"theorem","line":224,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L224-L228","doc":"The top state is killed by every raising operator (the ladder terminates). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.fock_chain","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.fock_chain","kind":"theorem","line":213,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L213-L222","doc":"**The ladder**: each Fock vector is the stated chain of raising operators on `Ω`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.fock_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.fock_zero","kind":"theorem","line":211,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L211-L211","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.level","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.level","kind":"def","line":207,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L207-L209","doc":"The fermion level (number of `α†`'s) of each Fock vector. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.fock","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.fock","kind":"def","line":194,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L194-L205","doc":"The eight Fock vectors (scaled by `2^level`), in Furey's order (6.19):\n`0 : ν = Ω`, `1,2,3 : d̄ʳᵍᵇ = αⱼ†Ω`, `4 : uʳ = α₃†α₂†Ω`, `5 : uᵍ = α₁†α₃†Ω`,\n`6 : uᵇ = α₂†α₁†Ω`, `7 : e⁺ = α₃†α₂†α₁†Ω`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.omegaD_omega_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.omegaD_omega_apply","kind":"theorem","line":177,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L177-L189","doc":"**The conjugate idempotent `ω†ω`** (Furey (6.21)) is rank one onto `Ω' = vac (−i)`: the\n`S_d` vacuum is the Galois conjugate of the `S_u` vacuum. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.vacD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.vacD","kind":"def","line":174,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L174-L175","doc":"The `S_d` vacuum vector `Ω' = 1 − i e₁ = vac (−i)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.omega_omegaD_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.omega_omegaD_apply","kind":"theorem","line":160,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L160-L171","doc":"**The idempotent, scaled.** `β₀β₁β₂β₂†β₁†β₀† x = 32 (x₀ − i x₁) Ω`, i.e.\n`ωω† x = ½(x₀ − i x₁) · Ω`: a rank-one operator onto the vacuum line. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.Bm_vac","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.Bm_vac","kind":"theorem","line":154,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L154-L158","doc":"The annihilators kill the vacuum: `αⱼ Ω = 0` (Furey (6.20)). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.vac","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.vac","kind":"def","line":151,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L151-L152","doc":"The `S_u` vacuum vector `Ω = 1 + i e₁` (the image of `ωω†`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.car_Bd_Bd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.car_Bd_Bd","kind":"theorem","line":140,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L140-L146","doc":"`{βₐ†, β_b†} = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.car_Bm_Bm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.car_Bm_Bm","kind":"theorem","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L132-L138","doc":"`{βₐ, β_b} = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.car_Bm_Bd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.car_Bm_Bd","kind":"theorem","line":124,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L124-L130","doc":"`{βₐ, β_b†} = 4 δₐ_b` (i.e. `{αₐ, α_b†} = δₐ_b`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.Bd_eq_neg_Bm_neg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.Bd_eq_neg_Bm_neg","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L116-L118","doc":"**Galois form of the dagger**: `βⱼ†` at root `i` is `−βⱼ` at the conjugate root `−i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.Bd_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.Bd_eq","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L112-L114","doc":"**`Bd` is left multiplication by `βⱼ†`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.Bm_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.Bm_eq","kind":"theorem","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L108-L110","doc":"**`Bm` is left multiplication by `βⱼ`** in the corpus table. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.Bd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.Bd","kind":"def","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L102-L106","doc":"`Bd i j x = βⱼ† x` written out. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.Bm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.Bm","kind":"def","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L96-L100","doc":"`Bm i j x = βⱼ x` written out (each component has two terms). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.betaD_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.betaD_eq","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L93-L94","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.betaD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.betaD","kind":"def","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L86-L91","doc":"`βⱼ† = 2αⱼ†`, the Furey hermitian conjugate (`i ↦ −i` together with octonion\nconjugation): `betaD i j = oconj (beta (−i) j)` (`betaD_eq`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.beta","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.beta","kind":"def","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L80-L84","doc":"`βⱼ = 2αⱼ`: `β₀ = −e₆ + i e₅`, `β₁ = −e₄ + i e₂`, `β₂ = −e₇ + i e₃`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.oconj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.oconj","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L75-L76","doc":"The octonion conjugate `x₀ − Σ xₖ eₖ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.omul_smul_left","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.omul_smul_left","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L71-L73","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.omul_add_left","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.omul_add_left","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L68-L69","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.omul_smul_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.omul_smul_right","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L64-L66","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.omul_add_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.omul_add_right","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L60-L62","doc":"Left multiplication is additive and homogeneous in the right argument. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.omul_map","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.omul_map","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L54-L58","doc":"**`omul` is the corpus table**: base change of `octMul` along any ring map `ℚ → R`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.omul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.omul","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyMinimalLeftIdeal.lean#L50-L52","doc":"The corpus octonion product (Baez convention), over a generic commutative ring. ","signatureChunk":0}]}